  "steps": [
    "Grains (prawn, salmon and chicken bowls): Use 2 parts water to 1 part grain. Bring the grain and water to a boil, cover, and simmer on low until the water is absorbed, about 15 min for quinoa and 18 min for white rice. Rest covered 5 min and fluff.",
    "Roasting (steak and egg bowls): Heat the oven to 450°F or an air fryer to 425°F. Toss the diced sweet potato or potato with 1 tsp olive oil, salt and pepper and roast 18 to 23 min, tossing halfway, until browned and tender. Add the asparagus to the sweet potato for the last 8 min.",
    "Beef taco bowl: Brown the mince in a skillet over medium-high heat with the taco seasoning, breaking it up, 6 to 8 min, until no pink remains. Rinse the black beans. Assemble the bowl with the lettuce, tomato, beans, beef, avocado, cheese and yogurt, and garnish with cilantro.",
    "Pineapple and prawn bowl: Char the pineapple rings on a hot grill or grill pan 2 to 3 min per side, then cut into chunks. Cook the prawns with the garlic in the olive oil over medium-high heat 1 to 2 min per side, until pink and opaque. Assemble over the quinoa with the cabbage, cucumber, capsicum and pomegranate.",
    "Salmon and avocado bowl: Season the salmon and sear in the olive oil in a skillet over medium-high heat 3 to 4 min per side, until it flakes and reads 145°F. Steam the edamame 3 to 5 min. Assemble over the rice with the carrot, cucumber, avocado and ginger, and garnish with sesame seeds.",
    "Beef and sweet potato bowl: Season the steak and sear in 1 tsp olive oil in a hot skillet 3 to 4 min per side for medium-rare (130°F to 135°F). Rest 5 min and slice. Assemble with the spinach, roasted sweet potato and asparagus, onion, tomatoes and avocado, and garnish with sesame seeds.",
    "Mediterranean chicken bowl: Heat the oven to 400°F. Season the chicken, rub with 1 tsp olive oil and bake on a sheet pan with the cherry tomatoes (tossed in the other 1 tsp oil) 20 to 25 min, until the chicken reads 165°F and the tomatoes blister. Mix the lettuce, capsicum and onion into a salad. Assemble over the quinoa with the chicken, tomatoes, cucumber and yogurt, and garnish with feta.",
    "Egg and veggie bowl: Sauté the mushrooms in 1 tsp olive oil over medium-high heat 5 to 6 min, until browned. Scramble the eggs over medium-low heat until just set. Assemble with the roasted potato, onion, avocado and salsa, and garnish with cilantro."
  ],
  "tips": [
    "Each bowl is one serving. Scale any of them by the number of people eating."
  ],
